# Agent Chat Entry

## Metadata

```yaml
format: uimd
format-version: 1
kind: component
status: draft
description: "Heron-style assistant text entry."
tags: [component, simulation]
```

## Definition

```yaml
extends: uicontrol
```

## Members

```yaml
heading:
  type: spanlabel
  text: "Assistant"
  description: "Assistant role label."

body:
  type: spanlabel
  text: ""
  description: "Selectable Markdown-style transcript prose."

```

## Style

```yaml
this:
  border-width: 0
  background: "#00000000"
@body_panel:
  background: "#00000000"
  padding: 0, 1, 0, 1
@heading:
  color: "#a7f3d0"
  user-select: text
@body:
  color: "#cbd5e1"
  word-wrap: true
  user-select: text
```

